oday 2026-06-30; check "office r1 H6: with no limit the overtime of 06-30 is 450 minutes (the old code gave 0)" '.success and (.data.data[0]|.workedMinutes == 900 and .overtimeMinutes == 450 and .nightMinutes == 90)'

